    Bug 1919662 - Account Hub Advanced Configuration Button. r=arschmitz,aleca

    **How To Test**
    - Input an email in the initial setup and get all the way to the manual config setup
    - Adjust your port number and click advanced setup
    - The dialog should close and you should see your account set in the account settings page with the new port
    - Delete account and repeat for the outgoing manual config page

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D227005

